  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Asia-Europe Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian support towards the Asia-Europe Foundation (ASEF) strategy for the period July 2023 to June 2026. ASEF was established to promote better understanding between Asia and Europe through greater intellectual, cultural and people-to-people exchanges by collaborating with relevant Asian and European organizations and institutions of the Asia-Europe Meeting (&quot;ASEM&quot;) countries.Norway has been a member of ASEM/ASEF since 2012.</narrative>
  </description>
